---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/marketing/PageHero.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact FairMind | AI bias and AI governance questions"
  description="Contact FairMind about AI evaluation evidence, safety review, governance workflows, research, evaluator adapters, or product access."
>
  <div class="route-page">
    <PageHero
      signal="Talk plainly"
      title="Ask a precise"
      accent="assurance question."
      description="Tell us what produced the result, what decision it must support, and where the evidence chain breaks. Product access, evaluator adapters, AI safety review, governance workflows, and research collaboration are all in scope."
      proofs={[
        { label: 'Product', value: 'Evidence workflow', note: 'Evaluation, review, findings, remediation, retest, assurance package.' },
        { label: 'Research', value: 'Methods and measurement', note: 'Environmental evidence, AI BOM, claim boundaries, and reproducibility.' },
        { label: 'Integration', value: 'Evaluator adapters', note: 'Start with the artifact and contract your tool already produces.' },
      ]}
      primary={{ label: 'Send a question', href: '#contact-form' }}
      secondary={{ label: 'Request product access', href: '/request-access' }}
    />

    <section class="route-section" id="contact-form" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <header class="route-section-heading"><h2 id="contact-title">What should we inspect?</h2><p>For product-fit conversations, the request-access form asks for the most useful evidence-path detail. This form is for everything else.</p></header>
      <div class="route-form-grid">
        <form class="route-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xayzqjqw" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New FairMind question" />
          <div class="route-field"><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
          <div class="route-field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></div>
          <div class="route-field route-field-wide"><label for="subject">Topic</label><select id="subject" name="subject" required><option value="">Choose a topic</option><option value="product">Product question</option><option value="research">Research collaboration</option><option value="adapter">Evaluator adapter</option><option value="security">Security disclosure</option><option value="media">Media or speaking</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div>
          <div class="route-field route-field-wide"><label for="message">Question</label><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Include the system, evaluator, artifact, or decision context that matters." required></textarea></div>
          <div class="route-form-footer"><p>We use these details only to respond. Read the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Send question</button></div>
        </form>
        <aside class="route-aside-ledger" aria-label="Direct contact routes">
          <div><span>Email</span><strong><a href="mailto:support@fairmind.xyz">support@fairmind.xyz</a></strong><p>Product, research, integration, and general questions.</p></div>
          <div><span>Source</span><strong><a href="https://github.com/adhit-r/fairmind">github.com/adhit-r/fairmind</a></strong><p>Inspect the active code and raise technical issues in context.</p></div>
          <div><span>Documentation</span><strong><a href="https://docs.fairmind.xyz">docs.fairmind.xyz</a></strong><p>Product concepts, limitations, workflows, and reference material.</p></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
